    "title": "销售退货单",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202402/8e4582f38522d2670fc2058cb78464a5.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video></p>\n<p><strong>销售退货</strong></p>\n<p><strong>路径1</strong>：【销售】-【销售退货】-【新增销售退货单】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202512/acbd9bc1971bd52a376d71df7d22ccf2.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202308/c5f5fb0841815ebf358de78b77698a2f.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><strong>路径2</strong>：【销售】-【销售】-【查看】-【退货】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202308/f63a291fc0ce6086473d4620dfc11f8c.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202308/292ac0a75c31ec6a87dfa87b08ac3744.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><strong>业务场景</strong>：由于质量不合格、价格不正确等因素、或与销售合同相关条款不相符等原因，客户将销售货品退回。</p>\n<p><strong>功能说明</strong>：</p>\n<p>1、销售退货时，已出库的旧销售单不要修改。</p>\n<p>2、选择好退货商品后，只需要填入数量，自动显示负数</p>\n",
